    "black_sheen": {
      "_why": "W2-GATHER's green rare traits (loot_tables.json rare_trait.traits, spec 04:11): GatherService.stamp_traits writes attributes[trait] = true and Crafting copies it onto the tool. Spec 06:6 'Preserve source instance ID and rare traits'. Sync step: keep these six equal to loot_tables.json (economy_tests checks it). CRAFTFEEL: Crafting.apply_outcome writes a rolled trait as 1 (its trait level; a carried one keeps its value), so a trait is true or a level.",
      "type": "trait",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 60,
      "_assumption": "ASSUMPTION: a trait level is 1..60, the item level range; no doc bounds it and today's code only writes true or 1."
    },
